    "detailed_description": "Deskripted sak.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's Skrot-Robot time is a simple 2d-puzzle casual game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWork your way onwards in a series of different levels, defended by robots and supply goods.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFight off the desekrated variants of 'skrot-robots', with equipment and gun-weapons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect gold coins, gather xp, level-up, upgrade equipment and specialize the character with specific skills to be able to develop further onto the creep, coming from the robots and its robot-base.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the moment 5 levels are playable.<br />\r\nGet at least 1 star on a level to unlock the next one, - each with its own set of robots and supplies. Descend outwards onto the wilds, dry fields, and industries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped base from new, but kinda like games such as Dungeon Raid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvance from desolate places, later reach robot-base, with a damaging machine-gun and other types of gear.<br />\r\nDestroy all in its path, and leave nothing but garbage waste in its remnants.",
